<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Apex Legends Jitter Aim + slight camera kick reduction</Major>
    <Description>- Jitter Aim reduces horizontal recoil
- Added slight pull down on the mouse to reduce camera kick while spraying

Resolution used when making the script: 16:9 //can be used in any resolution

Sensitivity: 2.00 ingame and 1000CPI on mouse software //if used on other sens settings screen can get a bit more shakey

Charge Rifle: Need to pull up a little due to the camera kick reduction

Hotkey ON/OFF: recommended on Mouse1 Button</Description>
    <Comment>Single/Burst shot weapons works with no changes  //there is a small recoil improvement on g7 scout and 30-30</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
MoveR 4 1
Delay 5 ms
MoveR -4 0
Delay 5 ms
MoveR 4 0
Delay 5 ms
MoveR -4 0
Delay 5 ms
Goto 2</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Apex Legends</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>